  {
   "name": "④ 一次性消费 · 重放同一根棒子必须失败",
   "item": [
    {
     "name": "重放旧棒子 → 409 ACPP_HANDOFF_CONSUMED",
     "request": {
      "method": "POST",
      "header": [
       {
        "key": "Content-Type",
        "value": "application/json"
       },
       {
        "key": "Authorization",
        "value": "Bearer {{agentActingTokenB}}"
       }
      ],
      "url": {
       "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent/collaboration-handoffs/claim",
       "host": [
        "{{baseUrl}}"
       ],
       "path": [
        "api",
        "v1",
        "agent",
        "collaboration-handoffs",
        "claim"
       ]
      },
      "description": "这是「同 token 双抢一成功」的串行版。真并发版在后端的 HandoffConcurrencyIntegrationTest\\n（2/8 线程同抢，恰好一个成功）。\\n\\n服务端靠一条带条件的 UPDATE 实现：WHERE status='AVAILABLE' —— 第二次必然 0 行。",
      "body": {
       "mode": "raw",
       "raw": "{\n  \"handoffToken\": \"{{handoffToken}}\"\n}"
      }
